[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Embedded Field Code
Comment=A file field code glued to other text. Deleting just the code would leave
Comment[x-note]=a dangling --file= argument, so the whole token is dropped instead and
Comment[x-note2]=a warning is recorded.
Exec=/usr/bin/embedded --file=%f --keep-me
Icon=embedded-fieldcode
Terminal=false
